{"seq":4,"slug":"digital-economy","title":"数字经济","stage":"DONE","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/digital-economy","introMarkdown":"# 数字经济 简介\n\n数字经济是经济学门类下的新兴交叉学科专业（专业代码020109T），以\"经济学+数据科学+人工智能\"为核心培养导向，授予经济学学士学位。本课程体系面向大学数字经济专业学生，旨在培养兼具经济学理论素养与数字技术实践能力的复合型人才。\n\n2025年我国数字经济增加值约49万亿元，占GDP约35%，数字经济已成为驱动经济增长的核心引擎。2024年全国高校新增该专业布点76个，仅次于人工智能专业，反映了社会对数字经济人才的迫切需求。\n\n本课程分为四章，构建从理论基础到实践应用的完整知识体系：\n\n**第一章 经济学与数据科学基础** 系统讲解数字经济理论框架、数据科学在经济研究中的应用方法论、以及平台经济学的核心模型，为后续学习奠定理论与方法基础。\n\n**第二章 数字技术应用** 深入探讨区块链与金融科技、机器学习在经济分析中的应用、大数据分析技术三大核心工具，培养学生的技术实践能力。\n\n**第三章 数字产业转型** 聚焦数字金融、数字贸易、数字营销三大产业领域的数字化转型实践，帮助学生理解数字技术如何重塑传统产业格局。\n\n**第四章 治理与政策** 围绕数据治理与监管、数字经济政策体系、数字经济核算方法展开，培养学生的政策分析与制度设计能力。\n\n推荐学习路径：先修第一章建立经济学与数据科学双重基础，再通过第二章掌握关键技术工具，然后在第三章中将理论与技术结合到产业实践，最后通过第四章形成宏观视野与政策思维。建议在学习过程中结合Python编程实践与真实数据集分析，强化理论与实操的融合。\n\n南京大学、中国传媒大学、华中科技大学等高校的数字经济专业建设经验值得参考，各校在课程体系设计上各有侧重，建议结合自身兴趣方向深入某一领域。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"economics-data-science-foundations","title":"经济学与数据科学基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/digital-economy/economics-data-science-foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"digital-economy-theory","title":"数字经济理论体系","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/digital-economy/economics-data-science-foundations/digital-economy-theory"},{"seq":2,"slug":"data-science-for-economics","title":"经济学数据科学方法","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/digital-economy/economics-data-science-foundations/data-science-for-economics"},{"seq":3,"slug":"platform-economics","title":"平台经济学","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/digital-economy/economics-data-science-foundations/platform-economics"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"digital-technology-applications","title":"数字技术应用","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/digital-economy/digital-technology-applications","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"blockchain-and-fintech","title":"区块链与金融科技","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/digital-economy/digital-technology-applications/blockchain-and-fintech"},{"seq":2,"slug":"machine-learning-economics","title":"机器学习与经济分析","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/digital-economy/digital-technology-applications/machine-learning-economics"},{"seq":3,"slug":"big-data-analytics","title":"大数据分析技术","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/digital-economy/digital-technology-applications/big-data-analytics"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"digital-industry-transformation","title":"数字产业转型","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/digital-economy/digital-industry-transformation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"digital-finance","title":"数字金融","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/digital-economy/digital-industry-transformation/digital-finance"},{"seq":2,"slug":"digital-trade","title":"数字贸易","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/digital-economy/digital-industry-transformation/digital-trade"},{"seq":3,"slug":"digital-marketing","title":"数字营销","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/digital-economy/digital-industry-transformation/digital-marketing"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"governance-and-policy","title":"治理与政策","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/digital-economy/governance-and-policy","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"data-governance-regulation","title":"数据治理与监管","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/digital-economy/governance-and-policy/data-governance-regulation"},{"seq":2,"slug":"digital-economy-policy","title":"数字经济政策体系","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/digital-economy/governance-and-policy/digital-economy-policy"},{"seq":3,"slug":"digital-economy-measurement","title":"数字经济核算","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/digital-economy/governance-and-policy/digital-economy-measurement"}]}]}